      "expected": "C11 should be a capacitor with a capacitor footprint, and both pins should be connected to appropriate nets (e.g., a power rail and ground).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(comp (ref \"C11\") (value \"0.1uF\") (footprint \"Inductor_SMD:L_0805_2012Metric_Pad1.05x1.20mm_HandSolder\") ... (libsource (lib \"Device\") (part \"C\") (description \"Unpolarized capacitor\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"58\") (name \"unconnected-(C11-Pad1)\") (class \"Default\") (node (ref \"C11\") (pin \"1\") (pintype \"passive\")))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "C11 is non-functional; if intended as a decoupling capacitor, the rail is not decoupled. The wrong footprint may prevent assembly.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
